WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.743 line:77%
Open Scan Projects from the project library.

00:00:02.743 --> 00:00:06.971 line:77%
Enter the folder where you keep your code, or click Choose Folder.

00:00:06.971 --> 00:00:10.758 line:77%
Review the results and keep only the projects you want to manage.

00:00:10.758 --> 00:00:14.481 line:77%
Deselect the project you don't need. Import only demo-notes.

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:18.632 line:77%
The project appears in your library. Scanning and importing run no project commands.
